1795385934708664	codex-groom	itc:AQ		item.create	bn-ijh	{"description":"Wire the existing M1 checks into the ordinary project test entry point as they land. For the retained invariants and fixtures in the M0 disposition, identify their named test or qualification runner. Keep host-dependent qualification results separate from the fast local run.\n\nAcceptance\n- On a fresh checkout, the documented command runs the shipped status properties, store tests, read-only network-sink assertions and generated example checks. A deliberately stale example or failing property makes the command fail.\n- Show which retained checks are due in a later milestone and which require a named runner. Skips and unavailable dependencies remain visible in gate results.\n\nSee plan §13–14 and evaluation §13.","kind":"task","labels":["m1","test","docs","integration"],"parent":"bn-2e6","size":"s","title":"M1.12 Run the shipped invariant and documentation checks on every change"}	blake3:GcYwAXer9cQCrSRzYqhUequV2l_EZ4YyPs3lTxURVZs
