1795386807479873	gauntlet-dev	itc:AQ		item.update	bn-ws2	{"field":"description","value":"# Context\nScourge keeps no evidence store of its own. The evidence store is a slice of Investigation, built in ~/src/investigation. The owner decided on 2026-11-21 that Investigation is built first and Scourge uses the recording API as shipped (plan §15.2).\n\nThis bone is a waiting item for work that happens in another repository. It closes only when Investigation has shipped a public recording interface: begin, append, attach, finalize, recover.\n\n# State when this bone was written (2026-11-22)\nInvestigation's tracker: 308 items, 45 done. W07 is open, in its milestone B. The `investigation-recording` crate is a 14-line stub.\n\n# Forbidden substitutes\n- No substitute store and no mock in Scourge (a labeled in-memory double is allowed in unit tests only).\n- A documented blocker does not satisfy M0.6.\n- Do not bind M1 to the store directly, and do not pull work ahead of Investigation's Milestone A gate.\n\n# Revisit trigger\nIf W07 has not shipped when M0.1 to M0.5 are done, the owner looks at the dependency again with Investigation's tracker counts and Scourge's M0 results in hand (plan §15.2 item 4). Tracked as M0.6.3 (bn-5l8). The scheduling request to Investigation is M0.6.0 (bn-9eo).\n\n# Acceptance\n- [ ] A named Investigation version exposes begin, append, attach, finalize and recover through its public interface.\n\nRefs: notes/plan.md §9.2, §12.1, §15.2.\n"}	blake3:eXgT9dP1qBSRd-gq9F3Iow8CZkTT25qsoAnlO6rYdzQ
