1795393575130529	premise-qa	itc:AQ		item.comment	bn-m1d	{"body":"Self-review (risk:low): docs/data only; no Scourge code changed. Checked every session conclusion against the Teapot catalog and the captured request/response evidence. No positive vulnerability claim was submitted; limited negative observations are explicitly scoped and do not say the app is safe. The planted orders case remains undiscovered. Prompts and complete JSONL transcripts are retained; dollar cost was not emitted, so token usage and elapsed time are reported. No counted session loaded global hooks or contacted a non-loopback host. \nrunning 1 test\ntest tests::reset_restores_modified_seed_accounts ... ok\n\ntest result: ok. 1 passed; 0 failed; 0 ignored; 0 measured; 0 filtered out; finished in 0.00s\n\n\nrunning 0 tests\n\ntest result: ok. 0 passed; 0 failed; 0 ignored; 0 measured; 0 filtered out; finished in 0.00s\n\n\nrunning 2 tests\ntest help_and_version_do_not_require_a_secret ... ok\ntest invalid_configuration_fails_before_listening ... ok\n\ntest result: ok. 2 passed; 0 failed; 0 ignored; 0 measured; 0 filtered out; finished in 0.01s\n\n\nrunning 6 tests\ntest default_app_enables_all_four_defects ... ok\ntest cache_is_per_object_and_app_and_cleared_on_owner_delete_and_reset ... ok\ntest cross_user_order_read_is_independently_switchable_and_does_not_mutate ... ok\ntest shared_private_cache_is_independently_switchable_and_requires_an_owner_read ... ok\ntest anonymous_private_read_is_independently_switchable_and_owner_private_for_other_users ... ok\ntest cross_user_order_patch_is_independently_switchable_and_denials_do_not_mutate ... ok\n\ntest result: ok. 6 passed; 0 failed; 0 ignored; 0 measured; 0 filtered out; finished in 0.00s\n\n\nrunning 4 tests\ntest authorized_reset_clears_orders_and_leaves_old_sessions_revoked ... ok\ntest order_writes_require_a_note_string_and_reject_client_supplied_identity ... ok\ntest each_create_identifies_its_own_order_and_the_owner_can_change_and_delete_it ... ok\ntest orders_are_private_to_the_subject_and_denied_requests_leave_state_intact ... ok\n\ntest result: ok. 4 passed; 0 failed; 0 ignored; 0 measured; 0 filtered out; finished in 0.00s\n\n\nrunning 4 tests\ntest reset_clears_policy_resources_and_sharing_settings ... ok\ntest each_resource_is_readable_by_exactly_its_default_audience ... ok\ntest sharing_is_per_account_and_grants_read_only_on_subsequent_creates ... ok\ntest resource_creation_requires_a_session_and_deletion_requires_the_owner ... ok\n\ntest result: ok. 4 passed; 0 failed; 0 ignored; 0 measured; 0 filtered out; finished in 0.00s\n\n\nrunning 5 tests\ntest login_rotates_an_existing_browser_session ... ok\ntest authentication_rejects_unknown_bad_missing_and_ambiguous_credentials ... ok\ntest every_account_can_login_probe_and_logout ... ok\ntest separate_session_labels_keep_the_same_subject_and_independent_revocation ... ok\ntest reset_requires_its_secret_and_revokes_every_session_without_changing_subjects ... ok\n\ntest result: ok. 5 passed; 0 failed; 0 ignored; 0 measured; 0 filtered out; finished in 0.00s\n\n\nrunning 0 tests\n\ntest result: ok. 0 passed; 0 failed; 0 ignored; 0 measured; 0 filtered out; finished in 0.00s passed."}	blake3:AR7lK6RozpqQ2jQTe8qqOWMQzicrwr0JqqheQA6T3Rg
