1795468977900742	m07-schema-codex	itc:AQ		item.comment	bn-2yt	{"body":"Seal cr-2msyia P1/P2 fixed in workspace bn-2yt at exact HEAD ba7a7e9bb1f61ee28c5c0fe8dfb857ab6b1d148a.\n\nChanges: schemas/engagement.v1.schema.json requires engagement.target_version; scripts/check-schema-contracts.py enforces a nonempty forward citation range for every present citation (document and inferred) before the inferred early return; ADR wording in docs/adr/engagement-schema.md and docs/adr/policy-rule-schema.md updated. Negative regressions: omitted target_version, inferred reversed start 10/end 5, inferred empty start 5/end 5, document reversed start 10/end 5 (plus existing document empty); all four new cases fail against HEAD~1 and pass at ba7a7e9.\n\nChecks at ba7a7e9: just schema-check OK (11 tests); full just check EXIT=0. Both Seal threads th-xivvs4 and th-89gfi6 resolved with evidence; cr-2msyia retargeted base f0d59c0 -> target ba7a7e9, reviewers [scourge-security], votes cleared, awaiting fresh review. Not approved, merged, closed, pushed or claim-released."}	blake3:haMELa23DUOnuRTn6lW2TXw1Gks5noHItzyFxiWxiS8
1795468977996730	m07-oracle-codex	itc:AQ		item.comment	bn-ggt	{"body":"Review cr-31iqn3 fixes committed at exact f934b3512ab5f647c59540952f5b1bf47e5d06da. P1: checker now binds the complete predicate object for both oracles and 8 subcase mutations cover true including always-true, false, exposure, and error; focused suite is 14 tests. P2: known miss now preserves that separate verifier principals close account-level state and only cross-account or tenant-wide state remains. Both Seal threads have evidence replies and are resolved. just oracle-spec-check and final full just check pass. Review retargeted and re-requested from review-oracle-specs; no approval/merge/close/push/release/destroy."}	blake3:Sl4Dcx_qSJdgNyZ2RwnXXajhxTAVqRi7QK-Mmg7i8fE
1795468983566995	m07-schema-codex	itc:AQ		item.comment	bn-2yt	{"body":"Correction to the check-evidence sentence in my previous comment on bn-2yt (no code change; HEAD remains ba7a7e9bb1f61ee28c5c0fe8dfb857ab6b1d148a): three newly added negative cases are the HEAD~1 regressions that fail with Invalid not raised and pass at ba7a7e9 - omitted engagement.target_version, inferred reversed start 10/end 5 (scripts/check-schema-contracts.py:500-502) and inferred empty start 5/end 5 (:503-505). The new document reversed start 10/end 5 case (:506-508) already raised under the previous document branch and is symmetry coverage, not a regression. just schema-check OK (11 tests), full just check EXIT=0."}	blake3:MFIsW0i-Mo4pbEN6wJR0Div0AMF5rDynTabWMIoojQ4
1795469116830460	m07-oracle-codex	itc:AQ		item.comment	bn-ggt	{"body":"Second review fix committed at exact 09a49ef0fe5cdbf883e9d1e05f898200c8017257. Added an explicit invalid_precedence drift regression for both oracle predicates by swapping precedence entries and requiring the unchanged exact-object checker to reject each. just oracle-spec-check passes 15 tests and final full just check passes. Thread th-2fypjv replied/resolved; cr-31iqn3 retargeted and re-requested from review-oracle-specs. No approval/merge/close/push/release/destroy."}	blake3:EL1V7_DP6N9YBYHvFgKgCaHXj_VNySZv2h2xr0Tm37M
